erhaps in the spirit of her family tradition, \"survival of the fittest,\" a girl of young body and stature on a journey by herself. Even at an age nearly half of Kei's, she is remarkably level-headed. Currently living her tough-as-nails lifestyle with her partner, the white fox Obana, in Kei's father's uninhabited house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Zohar's site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10498"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/6085980f2e3595c24f77edefb5a8dde4e21cd38bdbd24035a9efa0c707792470.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/934c88100f049ebe1b227c0c817019fb075b9bbbf2255e54778c6c5b4399e38a.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"釘宮 理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s500","name":"釘宮理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1189","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10499","characterName":"浅間 サクヤ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10499"},"originalCharacterName":"浅間 サクヤ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Role: Reportage writer and photographer"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful woman of unknown age who appears to be in her mid-twenties, with a distinctly non-Japanese style of living. As Kei's late mother's best friend, for whatever reason, she has taken it upon herself to look after Kei's well-being. She is frank and humorous, with the composure of an elder sister, but also has an \"old-timer\" side to her befitting (?) of her age. She likes alcoholic beverages and salty things. She dislikes Uzuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Zohar's site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10499"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9bdfc0960bbbc757856600219870a13c860b139377393b4d7d23a736b4df0a50.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e533824ea5edbea5b023c294d392800852f1edf1445d488e6fd764fb910ba84.webp","width":188,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真田 アサミ","creatorId":"vndb:s1712","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1712","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1712","name":"真田 アサミ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1192","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10500","characterName":"千羽 烏月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10500"},"originalCharacterName":"千羽 烏月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Role: Oni Slayer"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with beautiful posture, conduct, and black hair, who came to Hemidzuka on the same train as Kei. Carrying an ancient katana - Ito - within a golden sheath, she is thought by those at the hotel to be connected with the Ohashirasama festival that will be happening soon in Hemidzuka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Zohar's site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10500"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6ab608f6e99ea8edbbf6c747a5aff19ced5b88d58142cf2ba4ec